Package: ggconsulting
Type: Package
Title: Executive-Grade Themes and Helpers for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Vinicius", "Oike",
      email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: An opinionated 'ggplot2' extension for executive-grade
    consulting output, built to make slides and reports look polished
    without per-project tweaking. Ships a set of archetype themes that
    match common consulting deliverables (situation assessment, roadmap,
    benchmark, deep dive) and pairs them with coordinated color
    palettes and scale helpers. Locale-aware label functions format
    numbers, currency, and dates for Brazilian Portuguese and English
    audiences. A data-aware polish layer inspects the plot and applies
    sensible finishing touches, so charts stay readable and consistent
    across an entire engagement.
